<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise wins Budapest water contract.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise wins Budapest water contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Lyonnaise des Eaux said in a statement on Friday a consortium which it is leading had won a contract for the distribution of water in Budapest.</p>
<p>The deal involved selling a 25 percent stake in Budapest water group Fovarosi Vizmuvek to the consortium, which also includes Germany's RWE, it said.</p>
<p>The contract, for a period of 25 years and concerning supplies to two million people would be signed shortly, it added.</p>
<p>It did not put a value on the deal.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
